  "notes": "This presentation describes the strategic need for the wind energy industry to pursue coopetition as a core strategy for decarbonization and deployment.  It highlights several mechanisms for coopetition including open source software, open standards, joint ventures and Co-innovation.  This was presented at the Consortium for Energy and Data Science at Texas A&amp;M University on March 29, 2023.",
